# Keep the Docker build context lean and avoid host-only artifacts that break the build.
# (web is built INSIDE the image via web/Dockerfile; host node_modules must not be sent.)
**/node_modules
web/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
.git
data/
.evolution-queue/
# WSL/cmd HOME-path accidents — never send a literal Windows home tree into the build context.
C:*
**/C:*
.env
